:: Forest Raccoon
<<location "forest">><<effects>>


You drop to the ground and adopt a mating posture.
<<deviancy3>>

The <<beasttype>> slowly crawls out of the burrow and approaches you, giving your vulnerable form a curious sniff.
<<if $monster is 1>>
	<br><br>
	"Not used to company. Company willing, too. Very Nice."<br>
<</if>>

After inspecting you for a minute or so, the <<beasttype>> prepares to mount you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Forest Raccoon Sex]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<br>

